5. Our own measurements, head tracking (pods-motion)
   AirPods Pro (1st generation), same pair, 19 November 2026 (M0 bis, ter,
   quater; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, Head tracking):
   - sensors announced over RemoteHID only while sound plays to the buds;
     SensorDataWX silent on this model
   - report clock at byte 12 of the block in µs (19 892 µs apart for
     20 000 µs asked), angular rate 1/512 rad/s, gravity 1/1024 g
   - yaw as the twist of q_ref⁻¹·q about the reference gravity (the
     Euler yaw is wrong for a tilted bud); sign and scale from the spoken
     calibration; drift at rest
   Test fixtures: crates/pods-motion/tests/fixtures/ (sensor frames only;
   serial numbers and factory calibration in the plists masked).


